                                "sense_id": "cc1c775c-4a84-3f42-ae2b-7a4f127cc02a",
                                "text": "Gladiatorial entertainment was common in ancient Rome."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a57d8729-ccf3-4170-9645-1caa593cc9e1",
                                "sense_id": "cc1c775c-4a84-3f42-ae2b-7a4f127cc02a",
                                "text": "\"And all the better for yourself if you never enter the gladiatorial arena of public life: you will sacrifice time, health, and talents; you will be paragraphed—probably pelted; you will die of an inflammation, or a consumption; and leave it a debatable point to historians, what was the extent of the injury you did your country.\""
                            }
